83
00:05:16.803 --> 00:05:25.318
Volunteering in another country, you learn a new culture. Helping people abroad, you also become more confident and kind.

84
00:05:25.618 --> 00:05:27.455
Excellent answer, Visal!

85
00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:32.837
Great work! Now you can use eight new words and present participle clauses.

86
00:05:33.137 --> 00:05:39.286
Today's value is global citizenship. We all share one world. Help people near and far.

87
00:05:39.586 --> 00:05:42.273
